#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom/scripts.inc:64
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom_Text_IntroSpeech"
msgid ""
"I am the last of the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
"ELITE FOUR, DRAKE the DRAGON master!\p"
"In their natural state, POKéMON are\n"
"wild living things. They are free.\p"
"At times, they hinder us.\n"
"At times, they help us.\p"
"For us to battle with POKéMON as\n"
"partners, do you know what it takes?\p"
"Do you know what is needed?\p"
"If you don't, then you will never\n"
"prevail over me!$"
msgstr ""
"我是宝可梦联盟四天王的最后一人，\n"
"龙之大师源治！\p"
"在自然状态下，宝可梦是\n"
"野生的生物，它们是自由的。\p"
"它们有时会妨碍我们，\n"
"有时又会帮助我们。\p"
"要和宝可梦作为伙伴一起对战，\n"
"你知道需要什么吗？\p"
"你知道必须具备什么吗？\p"
"如果不知道的话，\n"
"你是绝对赢不了我的！$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom/scripts.inc:77
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom_Text_Defeat"
msgid "Superb, it should be said.$"
msgstr "了不起，不得不这么说。$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom/scripts.inc:80
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_DrakesRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech"
msgid ""
"You deserve every credit for coming\n"
"this far as a TRAINER of POKéMON.\p"
"You do seem to know what is needed.\p"
"Yes, what a TRAINER needs is a\n"
"virtuous heart.\p"
"POKéMON touch the good hearts of\n"
"TRAINERS and learn good from wrong.\p"
"They touch the good hearts of\n"
"TRAINERS and grow strong.\p"
"Go! Go onwards!\n"
"The CHAMPION is waiting!$"
msgstr ""
"作为宝可梦训练家，\n"
"能走到这里，你值得所有赞誉。\p"
"看来你确实知道需要什么。\p"
"没错，训练家需要的是\n"
"一颗善良的心。\p"
"宝可梦接触到训练家善良的心，\n"
"就能学会分辨是非。\p"
"宝可梦接触到训练家善良的心，\n"
"就能变得强大。\p"
"去吧！向前进吧！\n"
"冠军正在等着你！$"
